  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research on Community Based Education in Afghnanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The research seeks to understand differences in administration of social services between state and non-state actors by studying the handover process. This research project has two phases 1) research activities and 2) Randomized Controlled Trial (RCT). The first phase is funded by Danish Embassy for the period August 2013-July 2014 and covers the formative study of handover, RCT Design Meeting in Abu Dhabi and qualitative Methods training workshop in Kabul</narrative>
  </description>
